 CNSsolve>    stop 
 CNSsolve>  end if 
 CNSsolve>  evaluate ($Data.noecv = false) 
 CNSsolve>  noe 
 CNSsolve>    reset 
 CNSsolve>    nrestraints = 100000     ! allocate space for NOEs 
 CNSsolve>    ceiling 1000 
 CNSsolve>  end 
 CNSsolve>!  @RUN:protocols/contactairs.cns 
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>  !Read back in hbond data 
 CNSsolve>  if (&data.hbond_lastit ge &iteration) then 
